{"resourceIdentifier":"4848","resourceName":"Starch Plus Wastewater Treatment And Biogas Utilisation Project","description":"Starch Plus Wastewater Treatment Project (hereafter referred as the Project) is a project operated by Starch Plus Co., Ltd, located in Nakorn Ratchasima City, Thailand. The project\r\ninvolves the installation of a covered lagoon system (Modified Covered Lagoon), with 6 anaerobic open lagoons, to capture methane-rich biogas from the wastewater treatment system of the starch factory. The biogas is then sent to electricity generators, with an installed capacity 2.1 MW, to generate electricity to be used in the starch factory and thermal energy to be utilized\r\nin the thermal boilers. In the case of excess biogas or emergency, the biogas will be flared. Prior to the project activity, baseline scenario, the wastewater would have been treated in a series of anaerobic open lagoons (series of 6 open lagoons), resulting in the release of methane gas in the atmosphere, due to anaerobic digestion of organic contents in the lagoon. Furthermore, the factory utilizes fossil fuels in the thermal boilers and injects electricity from the national grid to be used in the starch factory, which is largely generated by fossil-fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":15.269999,"longitude":102.709997},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-05-01","endExclusive":"2024-06-01","endInclusive":"2024-05-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4848"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Nakhon Ratchasima Provinc"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Starch Plus Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Thailand"},{"type":"string","value":"+66 814101467"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"37970"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.C.,AMS-I.F.,AMS-III.H."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"0 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4K Earth Science Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/01/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 27/09/2022 - 26/09/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=105620&IDKEY=88723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq08145649980","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_DRAFT_4848_30NOV2023..pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-09T15:03:06.253Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=105355&IDKEY=lkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909s145284545","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"4848_Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-02T15:42:24.053Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=112182&IDKEY=niquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf4154698978","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_PCP_4848_22APR2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-05-01T20:05:04.387Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=125705&IDKEY=ilksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098c173347195","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD 4848 18DEC2024_CLEAN.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-01-07T20:58:50.207Z"},{"uri":"htt